# Kind24 draft census

Day/night/day or night/day/night, full sampler in every phase. Sparse counts only750/1155; no added Count clocks. Common branch footprint unpriced, day/night is not observer tax. Roles main/AO/emission/env/other annotate actual submitted calls. Core identity captures entered bags, accepted/culled partitions and exact numerical geometry/model/view/frustum/partition identity; accepted adjacent separately. Bbox and retained/baked actual event seams. Draft source is not frozen; helpers unreleased.

CENSUS schema has exactly25 counters f0..f24. Fields: entered, accepted, culled, sameGeometry, sameModelPtr, sameModelBits, sameVP, samePlanes, samePartition, eligibleAdjacent, bboxHit, bboxRecalc, bboxFresh, verticesRescanned, retainedBlockHit, retainedBlockBuild, retainedResize, retainedInvalidate, bakedHit, bakedCapture, acceptedAdjacent, retainedAcquireHit, retainedAcquireRebuild, retainedFresh, retainedRefused. Adjacency is among consecutive nonempty entered bags; empty-return invocations are absent. Identity capture runs immediately after original setMaxVertCount(maxVertCount), before main-frustum return. SamePartition requires actual maxVertCount AND actual clipPackageSize(), culling/transformation/fullClip/VU1clip/strip/billboard modes. Plane keys use six semantic normal.xyz+distance tuples, excluding uninitialized Vec4.w/padding.

Native root-proof hash and its exact501-source manifest, actual ELF and actual symbol hashes must agree with frozen source, provenance and actual files before release and every runtime preflight. No other fixture proof can qualify this fixture.
